CREATE OR REPLACE VIEW "viewfil1024i" ("料號", "管制日期", "刷回數量", "刷回桶數", "刷出數量", "刷出桶數", "日報使用量", "日報使用桶數") AS WITH "tmp0" /* 主檔 */ AS (SELECT DISTINCT "a"."料號", "a"."管制日期" FROM (SELECT DISTINCT "m"."料號", COALESCE(CAST(CASE WHEN "a"."其它日期1" = '00000000' THEN "a"."異動日期" ELSE "a"."其它日期1" END AS TEXT), '00000000') AS "管制日期" FROM "fil0044" AS "a" INNER JOIN "fil0043" AS "m" ON "m"."條碼" = "a"."條碼" INNER JOIN "viewfil1024h" AS "b" ON "b"."條碼" = "a"."條碼" WHERE ("a"."條碼" LIKE 'D11%' OR "a"."條碼" LIKE 'E11%') AND "a"."來源" <> ' ' AND "a"."序號" <> COALESCE("b"."首筆序號", 0) AND ORA_SUBSTR("m"."料號", 1, 1) = 'B' UNION ALL SELECT DISTINCT "m"."料號", COALESCE("e"."單據日期", '00000000') AS "管制日期" FROM "fil0041" AS "a" INNER JOIN "fil0043" AS "m" ON "m"."條碼" = "a"."文數字4" INNER JOIN "fil0040" AS "b" ON "b"."單據類別" = "a"."單別" AND "b"."單據編號" = "a"."單號" AND "b"."單據序號" = "a"."序號" INNER JOIN "fil0031" AS "d" ON "d"."單別" = "a"."單別" AND "d"."單號" = "a"."單號" INNER JOIN "fil0030" AS "e" ON "e"."單據類別" = "a"."單別" AND "e"."單據編號" = "a"."單號" WHERE "a"."單別" = 'C41' AND ("d"."製程代碼" BETWEEN 'C31A' AND 'C31C' OR "d"."製程代碼" = 'C32D') AND ORA_SUBSTR("m"."料號", 1, 1) = 'B') AS "a"), "tmp1" /* 刷回 */ AS (SELECT "m"."料號", COALESCE(TO_CHAR(TO_DATE("a"."異動日期", 'YYYYMMDD') + (CASE WHEN "a"."異動時間" >= '000000' AND "a"."異動時間" <= '070000' THEN -1 ELSE 0 END), 'YYYYMMDD'), '00000000') AS "管制日期", "a"."來源", COUNT("a"."條碼") AS "桶數", SUM("m"."庫存異動數") AS "異動數量" FROM "fil0044" AS "a" INNER JOIN "fil0043" AS "m" ON "m"."條碼" = "a"."條碼" INNER JOIN "viewfil1024h" AS "b" ON "b"."條碼" = "a"."條碼" WHERE ("a"."條碼" LIKE 'D11%' OR "a"."條碼" LIKE 'E11%') AND "a"."來源" = 'I' AND "a"."序號" <> COALESCE("b"."首筆序號", 0) AND ORA_SUBSTR("m"."料號", 1, 1) = 'B' GROUP BY "m"."料號", COALESCE(TO_CHAR(TO_DATE("a"."異動日期", 'YYYYMMDD') + (CASE WHEN "a"."異動時間" >= '000000' AND "a"."異動時間" <= '070000' THEN -1 ELSE 0 END), 'YYYYMMDD'), '00000000'), "a"."來源"), "tmp2" /* 刷出 */ AS (SELECT "m"."料號", COALESCE(CAST(CASE WHEN "a"."其它日期1" = '00000000' THEN "a"."異動日期" ELSE "a"."其它日期1" END AS TEXT), '00000000') AS "管制日期", "a"."來源", COUNT("a"."條碼") AS "桶數", SUM(ABS("m"."庫存異動數")) AS "異動數量" FROM "fil0044" AS "a" INNER JOIN "fil0043" AS "m" ON "m"."條碼" = "a"."條碼" WHERE ("a"."條碼" LIKE 'D11%' OR "a"."條碼" LIKE 'E11%') AND "a"."來源" = 'O' AND ORA_SUBSTR("m"."料號", 1, 1) = 'B' GROUP BY "m"."料號", COALESCE(CAST(CASE WHEN "a"."其它日期1" = '00000000' THEN "a"."異動日期" ELSE "a"."其它日期1" END AS TEXT), '00000000'), "a"."來源"), "tmp3" /* 日報領用 */ AS (SELECT "m"."料號", COALESCE("e"."單據日期", '00000000') AS "管制日期", SUM(CASE WHEN "b"."退庫數量" = 0 THEN 1 ELSE 0 END) AS "桶數", SUM("b"."異動數量" - "b"."退庫數量" - "b"."毛重") AS "異動數量" FROM "fil0041" AS "a" INNER JOIN "fil0043" AS "m" ON "m"."條碼" = "a"."文數字4" INNER JOIN "fil0040" AS "b" ON "b"."單據類別" = "a"."單別" AND "b"."單據編號" = "a"."單號" AND "b"."單據序號" = "a"."序號" INNER JOIN "fil0031" AS "d" ON "d"."單別" = "a"."單別" AND "d"."單號" = "a"."單號" INNER JOIN "fil0030" AS "e" ON "e"."單據類別" = "a"."單別" AND "e"."單據編號" = "a"."單號" WHERE "a"."單別" = 'C41' AND ("d"."製程代碼" BETWEEN 'C31A' AND 'C31C' OR "d"."製程代碼" = 'C32D') AND ORA_SUBSTR("m"."料號", 1, 1) = 'B' AND "b"."異動類別" = 'E' GROUP BY "m"."料號", COALESCE("e"."單據日期", '00000000')) SELECT DISTINCT "a"."料號", COALESCE("a"."管制日期", '00000000') AS "管制日期", COALESCE("b"."異動數量", 0) AS "刷回數量", COALESCE("b"."桶數", 0) AS "刷回桶數", COALESCE("c"."異動數量", 0) AS "刷出數量", COALESCE("c"."桶數", 0) AS "刷出桶數", COALESCE("d"."異動數量", 0) AS "日報使用量", COALESCE("d"."桶數", 0) AS "日報使用桶數" FROM "tmp0" AS "a" LEFT JOIN "tmp1" AS "b" ON "b"."料號" = "a"."料號" AND "b"."管制日期" = "a"."管制日期" LEFT JOIN "tmp2" AS "c" ON "c"."料號" = "a"."料號" AND "c"."管制日期" = "a"."管制日期" LEFT JOIN "tmp3" AS "d" ON "d"."料號" = "a"."料號" AND "d"."管制日期" = "a"."管制日期" WHERE ORA_SUBSTR("a"."料號", 1, 1) = 'B';

-- Oracle user_views
CREATE OR REPLACE VIEW "viewfil1024j" ("列印批號", "單據類別", "單據編號", "單據序號") AS WITH "tmp0" /* 主檔 */ AS (SELECT DISTINCT "m"."列印批號", "m"."條碼" FROM "fil0044a" AS "m" WHERE "m"."列印批號" LIKE 'QRC%') SELECT DISTINCT "a"."列印批號", REGEXP_SUBSTR("a"."條碼", '[^-]+', 1) AS "單據類別", REGEXP_SUBSTR("a"."條碼", '[^-]+', 1, 2) AS "單據編號", TO_NUMBER(REGEXP_SUBSTR("a"."條碼", '[^-]+', 1, 3)) AS "單據序號" FROM "tmp0" AS "a";

-- Oracle user_views
CREATE OR REPLACE VIEW "viewfil1027a" ("版銅編號", "最近取版日期") AS (SELECT "a"."產品編號" AS "版銅編號", MAX("a"."異動日期") AS "最近取版日期" FROM "fil0040" AS "a" INNER JOIN "fil0031" AS "b" ON "a"."單據類別" = "b"."單別" AND "a"."單據編號" = "b"."單號" WHERE "a"."單據類別" = 'C41' AND "b"."製程代碼" = 'C32E' AND "a"."單位代碼" = 'A' GROUP BY "a"."產品編號");

