CREATE OR REPLACE VIEW "viewfilh012" ("異動日期", "申請人", "請假時數", "出勤扣點", "出勤扣支", "午餐扣支", "伙食扣支") AS (SELECT "a"."異動日期", CASE WHEN "a"."單據類別" = 'H01' THEN "b"."申請人" ELSE "b1"."申請人" END AS "申請人", SUM("a"."異動數量") AS "請假時數", SUM(COALESCE(CASE WHEN "a"."異動數量" BETWEEN 2 AND 4 THEN CASE WHEN CASE WHEN "a"."單據類別" = 'H01' THEN "b"."假別名稱" ELSE "b1"."假別名稱" END = '事假' THEN 2 ELSE 1 END * 0.5 WHEN "a"."異動數量" > 4 THEN CASE WHEN CASE WHEN "a"."單據類別" = 'H01' THEN "b"."假別名稱" ELSE "b1"."假別名稱" END = '事假' THEN 2 ELSE 1 END ELSE 0 END, 0)) AS "出勤扣點", SUM(COALESCE(CASE WHEN "a"."異動數量" BETWEEN 2 AND 4 THEN CASE WHEN CASE WHEN "a"."單據類別" = 'H01' THEN "b"."假別名稱" ELSE "b1"."假別名稱" END = '事假' THEN "c"."出勤日支" ELSE CAST("c"."出勤日支" AS DOUBLE PRECISION) / 2 END * 0.5 WHEN "a"."異動數量" > 4 THEN CASE WHEN CASE WHEN "a"."單據類別" = 'H01' THEN "b"."假別名稱" ELSE "b1"."假別名稱" END = '事假' THEN "c"."出勤日支" ELSE CAST("c"."出勤日支" AS DOUBLE PRECISION) / 2 END ELSE 0 END, 0)) AS "出勤扣支", SUM(COALESCE(CASE WHEN "a"."異動數量" BETWEEN 2 AND 4 THEN "c"."othfee1" * 0.5 WHEN "a"."異動數量" > 4 THEN "c"."othfee1" ELSE 0 END, 0)) AS "午餐扣支", SUM(COALESCE(CASE WHEN "a"."異動數量" BETWEEN 2 AND 4 THEN CAST("c"."伙食津貼" AS DOUBLE PRECISION) / 30 * 0.5 WHEN "a"."異動數量" > 4 THEN CAST("c"."伙食津貼" AS DOUBLE PRECISION) / 30 ELSE 0 END, 0)) AS "伙食扣支" FROM "fil0040" AS "a" LEFT JOIN "viewfilh001" AS "b" ON "b"."單別" = "a"."單據類別" AND "b"."單號" = "a"."單據編號" LEFT JOIN "viewfilh018" AS "b1" ON "b1"."單別" = "a"."單據類別" AND "b1"."單號" = "a"."單據編號" LEFT JOIN "hrfil2001" AS "c" ON "c"."員工編號" = CASE WHEN "a"."單據類別" = 'H01' THEN "b"."申請人" ELSE "b1"."申請人" END AND ORA_SUBSTR("a"."異動日期", 1, 6) = "c"."年月" WHERE "a"."單據類別" = 'H01' AND "b"."簽核狀態" = 'E' OR "a"."單據類別" = 'H05' AND "b1"."簽核狀態" = 'E' GROUP BY "a"."異動日期", CASE WHEN "a"."單據類別" = 'H01' THEN "b"."申請人" ELSE "b1"."申請人" END);

